{"content_hash": "3350db39dbe1e650", "version_id": 1023, "article_id": 103, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Anthropic hits Nasdaq in record $81bn IPO as AI experts protest", "title_zh": "Anthropic登陆纳斯达克，813亿美元IPO创纪录，AI专家联名反对", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1690375?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620302044902-30315ad936cb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YW50aHJvcGljJTIwaXBvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTUxNDE3NzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Annie Spratt on Unsplash", "author": "Annie Spratt", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@anniespratt?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/text-k35mDhjCJ0c?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(143, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(181, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "81ef2143d31f"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-20", "word_count": 184, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Anthropic, the company behind the Claude chatbot, has gone public in the biggest IPO ever. But on the same day, nearly 100 AI researchers signed a letter saying the company is not safe.", "lead_zh": "Claude聊天机器人背后的公司Anthropic正式上市，创下史上最大IPO纪录。但就在同一天，近百位AI研究者签署公开信，称这家公司并不安全。", "preview": "Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. This beat the roughly $75 billion record set by SpaceX in June. Seven", "preview_zh": "Anthropic以每股83美元发行9.8亿股，募资813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX今年6月创下的约750亿美元纪录。英伟达、微软、谷歌、台积电等七家科技巨头还同意以发行价额外认购260亿美元。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1006, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/103/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 77.2, "size_bytes": 464112, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 218, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@7c834fab/content/data/versions/1023.json", "paragraphs": ["Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. This beat the roughly $75 billion record set by SpaceX in June. Seven tech giants, including Nvidia, Microsoft, Google and TSMC, also agreed to buy $26 billion more at the same price.", "The company's revenue has grown fast, from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. More than half of Fortune 500 companies now pay for its products. However, Anthropic has promised to spend $900.9 billion on computing power and infrastructure, which is a huge bet.", "The protest letter, called The MisAnthropic Statement, brought together people who usually disagree. Some want AI to move faster, while others warn it could destroy humanity. They say Anthropic calls itself the safest AI company, yet sells fast self-improving AI as its main strength.", "Inside the company, young staff call themselves Ants and plan to give much of their new wealth to charity. Although they worry about AI risk, they believe a good company must win the race first. Critics say this logic is dangerous, because power is hard to control once you have it."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Anthropic以每股83美元发行9.8亿股，募资813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX今年6月创下的约750亿美元纪录。英伟达、微软、谷歌、台积电等七家科技巨头还同意以发行价额外认购260亿美元。", "公司营收增长很快，从2023年的4100万美元涨到2025年的46亿美元。目前超过半数《财富》500强企业是其付费客户。不过，Anthropic已承诺在算力和基础设施上投入9009亿美元，这是一场豪赌。", "名为《厌恶Anthropic声明》的公开信让平时意见相左的人站到了一起。有人主张AI加速发展，也有人警告AI可能毁灭人类。他们说，Anthropic自称最安全的AI公司，却把能自我改进的AI当作卖点。", "公司内部，年轻员工自称“蚂蚁”，计划把大部分新财富捐给慈善。尽管担心AI风险，他们仍相信好公司必须先赢下竞赛。批评者认为这种逻辑很危险，因为一旦掌权，权力就很难受控。"], "body": "Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. This beat the roughly $75 billion record set by SpaceX in June. Seven tech giants, including Nvidia, Microsoft, Google and TSMC, also agreed to buy $26 billion more at the same price.\n\nThe company's revenue has grown fast, from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. More than half of Fortune 500 companies now pay for its products. However, Anthropic has promised to spend $900.9 billion on computing power and infrastructure, which is a huge bet.\n\nThe protest letter, called The MisAnthropic Statement, brought together people who usually disagree. Some want AI to move faster, while others warn it could destroy humanity. They say Anthropic calls itself the safest AI company, yet sells fast self-improving AI as its main strength.\n\nInside the company, young staff call themselves Ants and plan to give much of their new wealth to charity. Although they worry about AI risk, they believe a good company must win the race first. Critics say this logic is dangerous, because power is hard to control once you have it.", "body_zh": "Anthropic以每股83美元发行9.8亿股，募资813.4亿美元，超过SpaceX今年6月创下的约750亿美元纪录。英伟达、微软、谷歌、台积电等七家科技巨头还同意以发行价额外认购260亿美元。\n\n公司营收增长很快，从2023年的4100万美元涨到2025年的46亿美元。目前超过半数《财富》500强企业是其付费客户。不过，Anthropic已承诺在算力和基础设施上投入9009亿美元，这是一场豪赌。\n\n名为《厌恶Anthropic声明》的公开信让平时意见相左的人站到了一起。有人主张AI加速发展，也有人警告AI可能毁灭人类。他们说，Anthropic自称最安全的AI公司，却把能自我改进的AI当作卖点。\n\n公司内部，年轻员工自称“蚂蚁”，计划把大部分新财富捐给慈善。尽管担心AI风险，他们仍相信好公司必须先赢下竞赛。批评者认为这种逻辑很危险，因为一旦掌权，权力就很难受控。", "text": "Anthropic sold 980 million shares at $83 each, raising $81.34 billion. This beat the roughly $75 billion record set by SpaceX in June. Seven tech giants, including Nvidia, Microsoft, Google and TSMC, also agreed to buy $26 billion more at the same price. The company's revenue has grown fast, from $41 million in 2023 to $4.6 billion in 2025. More than half of Fortune 500 companies now pay for its products. However, Anthropic has promised to spend $900.9 billion on computing power and infrastructure, which is a huge bet. The protest letter, called The MisAnthropic Statement, brought together people who usually disagree. Some want AI to move faster, while others warn it could destroy humanity. They say Anthropic calls itself the safest AI company, yet sells fast self-improving AI as its main strength. Inside the company, young staff call themselves Ants and plan to give much of their new wealth to charity. Although they worry about AI risk, they believe a good company must win the race first. Critics say this logic is dangerous, because power is hard to control once you have it.", "vocab": [{"word": "go public", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "上市", "note": "指公司首次向公众发行股票", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "raise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "筹集（资金）", "note": "raise money/funds 常见搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "record", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "break/set a record 打破/创下纪录", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "营收", "note": "公司收入，常用不可数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "infrastructure", "pos": "noun", "zh": "基础设施", "note": "此处指算力等硬件设施", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "protest", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抗议，反对", "note": "protest letter 公开抗议信", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "warn", "pos": "verb", "zh": "警告", "note": "warn that... 警告说……", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "self-improving", "pos": "adj", "zh": "自我改进的", "note": "指AI能帮助研发更强的AI", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "慈善机构", "note": "give money to charity 捐钱给慈善", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "critic", "pos": "noun", "zh": "批评者", "note": "critics say... 批评者说……", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-20T02:29:30.365050", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Anthropic", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.9, "sm": 350, "em": 900, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "sold", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.188, "sm": 900, "em": 1187, "cs": 10, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "980", "s": 1.188, "e": 2.05, "sm": 1187, "em": 2049, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "million", "s": 2.05, "e": 2.438, "sm": 2050, "em": 2437, "cs": 19, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "shares", "s": 2.438, "e": 2.862, "sm": 2437, "em": 2862, "cs": 27, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "at", "s": 2.862, "e": 3.012, "sm": 2862, "em": 3012, "cs": 34, "ce": 36, "si": 0}